nodes.body:
@hickeyma @xiezhq-hermann Could you advise whether there is an update on maintainer agreement for Phase 1 of #39991, or a preferred next step for that discussion?

This implementation remains a draft on hold, as agreed. I am not requesting implementation review or CI while the RFC scope is undecided. It covers additive event metadata only; replay framing and LoRA name/hash propagation remain separate.

The recorded local validation is preserved for reference. Once the scope is agreed, the branch and validation will need refreshing against current main, with coordination to avoid duplicating other work. Thanks!

